<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">We're excited to share that Flywire will be at Ellucian Live in Denver this month. We've an exciting line up so be sure s</span><span style="color: #0f476b;">top by <strong>booth #103</strong>.&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Check out our speaking session on <strong>Tuesday, April 12</strong>&nbsp;at <strong>1:30pm MST </strong>featuring&nbsp;<strong><em>Geri Landwehr</em>, Bursar</strong> at the <strong>University of Northern Colorado</strong> to see how leading higher education institutions are using actionable data to address affordability and keep more students enrolled. Later that day, join us at <strong>3:15pm MST</strong> to see a live demo and be included in our surprise raffle!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><span style="color: #0f476b;">And, if you're looking to adopt a puppy or you want some puppy love swing by our <strong>Puppy Cuddling session</strong> on <strong>Tuesday, April 12</strong> between <strong>10:30am - </strong><strong>4:00pm</strong>.</span></p> </td> 
